Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.00,Tag,,0,0,0,,VXO · AI-made · characters are AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:01.87,Otto,,0,0,0,,This candle has never
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:02.91,Otto,,0,0,0,,been filmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.61,Vee,,0,0,0,,It has now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.97,Vee,,0,0,0,,We're VXO. Product films
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.89,Vee,,0,0,0,,made with AI. Thirty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.97,Vee,,0,0,0,,seconds, one take, no
