Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:15.85,Otto,,0,0,0,,No crew. No studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.33,Otto,,0,0,0,,Just taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:19.25,Vee,,0,0,0,,Send us one product
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:21.01,Vee,,0,0,0,,photo. We send back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:23.01,Vee,,0,0,0,,five frames, free.
